# r13 AD style swatch: 32x32 eye + brow + bang tip at BUST scale (96x96 bust).
# Character's RIGHT eye (screen-left), 3/4 view facing screen-left. Light: upper-left front.
# Demonstrates: selective outline (plum on hair, line_skin on skin, ink only for lashes/pupil),
# 2px upper lash with outer wing, iris ramp dark-top -> light-bottom, 2x2 + 1px catchlights,
# 1px soft brow in hair_1, clumped bangs with broken angel-ring band, cast hair shadow on skin,
# blush as 3 diagonal hatches. No AA except 1 step (skin_mid) on the lash->skin outer wing.
size: 32 32
legend:
. = transparent
p = #4A2448   plum_0 hair line / deepest hair
h = #6E3C3A   hair_1 hair shadow
H = #A85A3A   hair_2 hair base
L = #D08658   hair_hi band highlight
s = #FCD6B4   skin_2 skin base
m = #F6BCA6   skin_mid 1-step AA / soft shade
S = #EBA586   skin_1 skin shadow (hair cast shadow)
l = #B0606A   line_skin skin line, lower lash
k = #20223E   ink lashes, pupil
a = #153E4E   iris_0
b = #2C9696   iris_1
c = #86DCC6   iris_2
w = #FFFFFF   snow_3 catchlight / sclera
W = #DFEAF6   snow_2 sclera shade under lash
r = #F06A58   red_2 blush hatch
